{
    "title": "Baby Name Together",
    "description": "Congratulations! You\u2019re totally pregnant! You have the bump\u2014but you still don\u2019t have a name! The joys of pregnancy are nearly endless, but spending endless hours searching for baby names without ever agreeing with your partner is definitely swipe-left-worthy. If you want an easy & fun way to find baby names that are popular af or totally unique, create custom baby announcements, research the meaning of names, or just want to pass the time, then Baby Name Together is the app for you!\r\n\r\nIt\u2019s so easy to create your list of favorite baby names and compare it with your spouse\u2019s list. Find *the perfect* baby name from the short list of matching names this app whips up for you. No more endless discussions or headaches\u2014we\u2019ll leave that up to the hormones. \r\n \r\n\ud83d\udc4d SWIPE TO LIKE\r\nSwipe to the right if you like a baby name, or swipe left if you don\u2019t. \r\n\ud83c\udf08 COLOR CODED\r\nBlue for boy names, pink for girl names, and purple for gender-neutral + unisex names.\r\n\ud83d\udc6b CONNECT YOUR LISTS\r\nBoth parents install the app and link their accounts through email address.\r\n\ud83d\udc95 SEE MATCHES\r\nConsult names that both parents love and choose THE perfect name from this short list. \r\n\ud83d\udca1 NEED INSPIRATION?\r\nCheck the top 20 baby names of many countries.\r\n\r\n\u2b50\ufe0fJOIN OUR THRIVING PARENT COMMUNITY \u2b50\ufe0f\r\n\u2022 Hi Mommy! Hi Daddy! And hello little human inside that belly bump! \r\n\u2022 Join a forum dedicated to parents and discuss topics related to names, pregnancy + parenthood\r\n\u2022 Submit or consult names proposed by the community of Moms, Dads, and Parents-To-Be\r\n\u2022 Create a poll and organize a vote to ask your friends, family or other users if they also love the name that you are thinking about for your baby\r\n\u2022 Need inspiration? See what other parents are naming their children to find the best name for your baby! \r\n  \r\n\r\n\r\nAWESOME APP FEATURES\r\n\ud83d\ude33 HUGE NAME LIST\r\n30,000 baby names and counting! New names added each day. Find original, cool, unusual and unique girl & boy names.\r\n\r\n\ud83d\udd0e SEARCH FILTER\r\nAdvanced filtering menu to get only the baby names that YOU love. Sort by gender (unisex / boy / girl names), first / last letter, length of first names, or compound names.\r\n\r\n\ud83d\udc8c CUSTOM BABY CARDS\r\nReady, set, glow! Announce the arrival of your baby with customizable baby announcement cards for gender reveal parties, baby showers, and the birth of your baby!\r\n\r\n\ud83e\udd29 NAME MEANING + MORE\r\nFind useful information like name meanings, statistics per country, popularity, average age, and celebrities with that name.\r\n\r\n\ud83d\udde3 PRONUNCIATION \r\nListen to the pronunciation of each name in different languages.\r\n\r\n\ud83c\udf0e BABY NAME ORIGINS \r\nDenmark, Finland, France, Germany, India, Ireland, Italy, Japan, Netherlands, Norway, French Polynesia, Portugal, Scotland, Sweden, United Kingdom and USA names.\r\n\r\n\ud83d\udce3 NEWS\r\nStay tuned for the latest news about baby names (celebrity baby names, top trending names, gender-neutral and unisex names, etc).\r\n\ud83d\ude0d SUPER MATCH & MORE\r\nDoes your daughter or son want to help name Baby, too? Share your list & collaborate with 4 people! How about adding a middle name or last name? What about theme names or special names? All of that and more is unlocked in our PRO version.\r\n\r\n\ud83d\udcf1 MULTI DEVICE\r\nUse your lists on all your devices at the same time (smartphones & tablets). (PRO only)\r\n\r\n\u2601\ufe0f CLOUD STORAGE\r\nYour name list is saved online and can be retrieved for your next baby. (PRO only)\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\ud83c\uddeb\ud83c\uddf7 Bonjour! I developed Baby Name Together when my wife was pregnant with our precious little peanut. We could not find baby names for our daughter, so I made a babyname app to help us (and other Moms and Dads) find trending, unique, and popular baby names. This app is just my part-time project, so I try to do my best to improve it while being a full-time husband and around-the-clock baby tracker :)\r\n \r\nGot an idea to help make this app even better? Send me a message at contact@linkinet.eu. Thanks in advance for your support, feedback, and reviews!\r\n \r\nMade in France with love,\r\n-- Sandy G.",
    "descriptionHTML": "Congratulations! You\u2019re totally pregnant! You have the bump\u2014but you still don\u2019t have a name! The joys of pregnancy are nearly endless, but spending endless hours searching for baby names without ever agreeing with your partner is definitely swipe-left-worthy. If you want an easy &amp; fun way to find baby names that are popular af or totally unique, create custom baby announcements, research the meaning of names, or just want to pass the time, then Baby Name Together is the app for you!<br><br>It\u2019s so easy to create your list of favorite baby names and compare it with your spouse\u2019s list. Find *the perfect* baby name from the short list of matching names this app whips up for you. No more endless discussions or headaches\u2014we\u2019ll leave that up to the hormones. <br> <br>\ud83d\udc4d SWIPE TO LIKE<br>Swipe to the right if you like a baby name, or swipe left if you don\u2019t. <br>\ud83c\udf08 COLOR CODED<br>Blue for boy names, pink for girl names, and purple for gender-neutral + unisex names.<br>\ud83d\udc6b CONNECT YOUR LISTS<br>Both parents install the app and link their accounts through email address.<br>\ud83d\udc95 SEE MATCHES<br>Consult names that both parents love and choose THE perfect name from this short list. <br>\ud83d\udca1 NEED INSPIRATION?<br>Check the top 20 baby names of many countries.<br><br>\u2b50\ufe0fJOIN OUR THRIVING PARENT COMMUNITY \u2b50\ufe0f<br>\u2022 Hi Mommy! Hi Daddy! And hello little human inside that belly bump! <br>\u2022 Join a forum dedicated to parents and discuss topics related to names, pregnancy + parenthood<br>\u2022 Submit or consult names proposed by the community of Moms, Dads, and Parents-To-Be<br>\u2022 Create a poll and organize a vote to ask your friends, family or other users if they also love the name that you are thinking about for your baby<br>\u2022 Need inspiration? See what other parents are naming their children to find the best name for your baby! <br>  <br><br><br>AWESOME APP FEATURES<br>\ud83d\ude33 HUGE NAME LIST<br>30,000 baby names and counting! New names added each day. Find original, cool, unusual and unique girl &amp; boy names.<br><br>\ud83d\udd0e SEARCH FILTER<br>Advanced filtering menu to get only the baby names that YOU love. Sort by gender (unisex / boy / girl names), first / last letter, length of first names, or compound names.<br><br>\ud83d\udc8c CUSTOM BABY CARDS<br>Ready, set, glow! Announce the arrival of your baby with customizable baby announcement cards for gender reveal parties, baby showers, and the birth of your baby!<br><br>\ud83e\udd29 NAME MEANING + MORE<br>Find useful information like name meanings, statistics per country, popularity, average age, and celebrities with that name.<br><br>\ud83d\udde3 PRONUNCIATION <br>Listen to the pronunciation of each name in different languages.<br><br>\ud83c\udf0e BABY NAME ORIGINS <br>Denmark, Finland, France, Germany, India, Ireland, Italy, Japan, Netherlands, Norway, French Polynesia, Portugal, Scotland, Sweden, United Kingdom and USA names.<br><br>\ud83d\udce3 NEWS<br>Stay tuned for the latest news about baby names (celebrity baby names, top trending names, gender-neutral and unisex names, etc).<br>\ud83d\ude0d SUPER MATCH &amp; MORE<br>Does your daughter or son want to help name Baby, too? Share your list &amp; collaborate with 4 people! How about adding a middle name or last name? What about theme names or special names? All of that and more is unlocked in our PRO version.<br><br>\ud83d\udcf1 MULTI DEVICE<br>Use your lists on all your devices at the same time (smartphones &amp; tablets). (PRO only)<br><br>\u2601\ufe0f CLOUD STORAGE<br>Your name list is saved online and can be retrieved for your next baby. (PRO only)<br><br><br><br>\ud83c\uddeb\ud83c\uddf7 Bonjour! I developed Baby Name Together when my wife was pregnant with our precious little peanut. We could not find baby names for our daughter, so I made a babyname app to help us (and other Moms and Dads) find trending, unique, and popular baby names. This app is just my part-time project, so I try to do my best to improve it while being a full-time husband and around-the-clock baby tracker :)<br> <br>Got an idea to help make this app even better? Send me a message at contact@linkinet.eu. Thanks in advance for your support, feedback, and reviews!<br> <br>Made in France with love,<br>-- Sandy G.",
